WEBVTT

00:00:59.846 --> 00:01:01.068
Don't give up.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.324
I am here with you,

00:01:03.348 --> 00:01:05.634
and you don't have to be scared.

00:01:05.658 --> 00:01:08.428
Please pull through and let us go home.

00:01:08.452 --> 00:01:10.039
You do not belong here."

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.501
Seven months later,

00:01:13.525 --> 00:01:16.073
he would be diagnosed with cerebral palsy,

00:01:17.326 --> 00:01:19.369
a nonprogressive brain injury

00:01:19.393 --> 00:01:23.914
which primarily affects body movement
and muscle coordination.

00:01:24.755 --> 00:01:30.494
About two to three children
out of 1,000 in the United States